{"Title":"An Act amending chapter 133 of the acts of 2022","BillNumber":"S2854","DocketNumber":"SD3321","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MDB0","Name":"Michael D. Brady","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MDB0","ResponseDate":"2024-07-02T12:31:09.5"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MDB0","Name":"Michael D. Brady","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MDB0","ResponseDate":"2024-07-02T12:31:09.5"},{"Id":"DFD1","Name":"David F. DeCoste","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DFD1","ResponseDate":"2024-07-02T12:32:44.0166667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2854/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Brady, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2854) of Michael D. Brady and David F. DeCoste for legislation amending a conservation restriction in the town of Hanson.  Municipalities and Regional Government.  [Local Approval Received.]","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Chapter 133 of the acts of 2022 is hereby amended by striking out section 3 and inserting in place thereof the following section:-\r\n\tSection 3. As consideration for the change in the conservation restriction authorized in section 1, the town of Hanson shall, pursuant to section 3 of chapter 40 of the General Laws, transfer the care, custody and control of a certain 25.405, more or less, acre parcel identified as the town of Hanson assessors’ map 49, parcel 1-1A and a 3,922, more or less, square foot parcel identified as assessors’ map 105, parcel 6 from the board of selectmen to the conservation commission for the purpose of wildlife, recreation and forestry.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[{"Description":"Local approval ","DownloadUrl":"http://malegislature.gov/api/DownloadReport?attachmentId=18785&title=Local%20approval%20"}],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J10","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J10"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S31"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}